Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Pawtation theme (unofficial): route UI colours through
 pawtation_theme.h

Private, unofficial cosmetic theme; not part of or supported by Swiss.
Cosmic palette for text, panels, selection, progress bar, tooltip,
title/menu bar fills, menu glow and backdrop tint.
